  "html": "<section class=\"container section--services-hero pt-5\">\n\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main\">\n\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row__left\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group flow has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group h-align icon-plus-title is-layout-flex wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">    <div class=\"iconblock wp-elements-1 has-background has-secondary-background-color has-text-color has-secondary-inverse-color\" data-size=\"md\" data-padding=\"2\" data-display=\"inline\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-drains\" /></svg>    </div>\n\n<h1 class=\"has-link-color wp-elements-2 wp-block-post-title has-text-color has-secondary-color has-x-large-font-size\">Trap and Pipe Cleaning in Greenville, SC</h1></div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group services-hero-description flow is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<p>Preventive cleaning for drain traps and branch lines throughout Greenville, SC.</p>\n<p>Carolina Heating Service provides trap and pipe cleaning throughout Greenville, SC, clearing the buildup that collects in drain traps and branch lines before it becomes a blockage. This is the maintenance side of drain work: instead of waiting for a clog to stop a fixture, the plumber removes what a clog would eventually be made of.</p>\n<p>Every fixture drain has a trap, the curved section of pipe that holds water to block sewer gas from entering the home. That curve is also where grease, soap scum, hair, and food debris settle first, which is why odors and slow drainage usually start there.</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<div  class=\"wp-block-group mb-3 full-width-mobile schedule-and-call-cta is-content-justification-left is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-a1b15d37 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-grou