ervices-hero__main section--services-hero__main--empty has-background has-secondary-background-color\"></div>\n\n</section>\n<!-- container /--><div id=\"types-of-services\" class=\"types-of-service-container container py-5 wp-elements-4 has-custom-acf-color has-background has-secondary-background-color has-text-color has-primary-inverse-color\"><!-- wp-block-columns/ -->\n        <div data-num-of-columns=\"4\" class=\"wp-block-columns mb-4 is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-layout-1 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n    <!-- column/ -->\n        <div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n            <div class=\"types-of-service__icon-title\">\n                    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"0\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-installation\" /></svg>    </div>\n                                        <h2 class=\"h3 text-left mt-0 font-size-5\">Trap and Pipe Cleaning: Installations</h2>\n                                    </div>\n                            <p>Trap and pipe cleaning installations are essential for maintaining a healthy plumbing system in both residential and commercial properties. Regular maintenance not only prevents clogs and backups but also extends the life of your plumbing infrastructure. Our expert team specializes in professional trap and pipe cleaning services, ensuring that your drains remain clear and functional. We use advanced techniques and eco-friendly products to thoroughly remove debris, grease, and sediment that can accumulate over time. Whether you&#8217;re looking to install new cleaning systems or need routine maintenance, our services cater to all your needs. With our commitment to customer satisfaction and prompt service, we have become a trusted choice for homeowners and businesses alike. Reach out today to learn more about our affordable installation options and discover how we can help you maintain a pristine plumbing environment. Don&#8217;t let dirty pipes disrupt your daily life—choose our reliable trap and pipe cleaning installations for peace of mind.</p>\n                            </div><!-- ./column -->\n        <!-- column/ -->\n        <div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n            <div class=\"types-of-service__icon-title\">\n                    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"0\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-toolbox\" /></svg>    </div>\n                                        <h2 class=\"h3 text-left mt-0 font-size-5\">Trap and Pipe Cleaning: Inspections & Repairs</h2>\n                                    </div>\n                            <p>Trap and pipe cleaning is an essential service for maintaining the hygiene and functionality of your plumbing system. Regular inspections and repairs not only prevent clogs but also extend the lifespan of your pipes, saving you money in the long run. Our expert team utilizes advanced techniques and equipment to thoroughly clean and inspect your traps and pipes, ensuring that any potential issues are identified and addressed promptly. Whether you&#8217;re facing slow drains, foul odors, or visible damage, our reliable services provide effective solutions tailored to your unique needs. We prioritize customer satisfaction and safety, guaranteeing that your home remains clean and your plumbing operates smoothly. Choose us for professional trap and pipe cleaning services, and experience the peace of mind that comes with a well-maintained plumbing system. Easily find us on Google Maps and in organic search results when you need skilled help with your pipe issues.</p>\n                            </div><!-- ./column -->\n        <!-- column/ -->\n        <div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n            <div class=\"types-of-service__icon-title\">\n                    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"0\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-maintenance\" /></svg>    </div>\n                                        <h2 class=\"h3 text-left mt-0 font-size-5\">Trap and Pipe Cleaning: Maintenance</h2>\n                                    </div>\n                            <p>Trap and pipe cleaning is an essential maintenance service that ensures your plumbing system operates efficiently and prevents costly repairs down the line. Regular cleaning of traps and pipes eliminates clogs caused by grease, food particles, and debris, promoting better drainage and improving overall hygiene in your home or business. If you&#8217;re searching for reliable and effective cleaning services, our expert team utilizes advanced techniques and eco-friendly products to restore your plumbing system to optimal condition. We cater to both residential and commercial properties, providing tailored solutions that meet your specific needs. Choosing professional trap and pipe cleaning not only enhances performance but also extends the lifespan of your plumbing infrastructure. Don&#8217;t wait until a minor issue escalates into a major problem; contact us today for prompt and thorough maintenance services in your area. Let us help you keep your pipes clean and your property running smoothly.</p>\n                            </div><!-- ./column -->\n        <!-- column/ -->\n        <div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n            <div class=\"types-of-service__icon-title\">\n                    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"0\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-technician-gears\" /></svg>    </div>\n                                        <h2 class=\"h3 text-left mt-0 font-size-5\">Trap and Pipe Cleaning: Customer Satisfaction</h2>\n                                    </div>\n                            <p>Trap and pipe cleaning services are essential for maintaining the health and efficiency of your plumbing system. Our expert team specializes in thorough cleaning solutions that ensure optimal flow and prevent costly blockages. With a focus on customer satisfaction, we use advanced techniques and eco-friendly products to tackle any buildup, ensuring your pipes run smoothly. Whether you are a homeowner facing slow drains or a business in need of routine maintenance, our reliable services cater to all your plumbing needs. Our commitment to quality and prompt service has earned us top ratings in the local community. Trust us to enhance your plumbing system&#8217;s performance and extend its lifespan while prioritizing your satisfaction. Contact us today for a free consultation and experience the difference in trap and pipe cleaning services.</p>\n                            </div><!-- ./column -->\n        </div><!-- ./ wp-block-columns --> </div><!-- ./container -->\n<div class=\"our-promise container \" id=\"our-promise\">\n<div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile box-shadow-lg border-radius-lg\">\n\n<figure class=\"our-promise__photo\">\n<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"/images/2024/03/Two-Carolina-Heating-Service-technicians-reviewing-an-item-on-a-laptop.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"Two Carolina Heating Service technicians reviewing an item on a laptop\" /></figure>\n<div class=\"our-promise__info\">\n    <p class=\"h3 our-promise__info__headline\">Drain Cleaning and Tackling Tough Clogs in Greenville and all Surrounding Areas</p>\n    <div class=\"our-promise__info__description\">At Carolina Heating Service, we provide exceptional drain solutions designed to tackle your plumbing challen